WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.613
- Are you just trying to get people

00:00:01.613 --> 00:00:04.015
to do things that are impossible,
so they look ridiculous?

00:00:05.068 --> 00:00:07.782
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.377 --> 00:00:12.690
- I don't even know what
muscle to flex to wiggle my...

00:00:14.678 --> 00:00:18.051
- Are they moving?

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:19.206
- I know how to wiggle my ears,

00:00:19.206 --> 00:00:20.244
it's been a talent that I've been

00:00:20.244 --> 00:00:22.281
pretty proud of, since I was a young tot.

00:00:22.281 --> 00:00:23.501
You ready?

00:00:25.271 --> 00:00:29.327
- You're moving your scalp,
what the hell? (laughs)

00:00:29.327 --> 00:00:31.864
- This is a good party trick.

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.187
- Do you know why some
people can wiggle their ears?

00:00:35.187 --> 00:00:36.901
It's an evolutionary thing.

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:39.883
'Cause you know how
animals can move their ears

00:00:39.883 --> 00:00:41.598
so specifically to hear noises?

00:00:41.598 --> 00:00:43.237
It's one of those muscles
that we don't really need,

00:00:43.237 --> 00:00:44.073
but we still have.

00:00:45.328 --> 00:00:46.751
- I can try to lick my elbow.

00:00:46.751 --> 00:00:49.216
I'm not sure I can pull it off.

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:51.496
There's no way.

00:00:51.496 --> 00:00:53.964
- (laughs) I'm so far away.

00:00:53.964 --> 00:00:56.577
No, can a human do that?

00:00:59.155 --> 00:01:00.140
- I can do it!

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:06.439
- (laughs) I can fit a
knuckle and a half, that's it.

00:01:06.439 --> 00:01:08.678
- I definitely can't put
my whole fist in my mouth,

00:01:08.678 --> 00:01:12.133
because I have huge, huge hands.

00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:16.386
- No. I'm afraid of
breaking my jaw even trying.

00:01:16.386 --> 00:01:18.739
Please show me the footage
of someone who can do that,

00:01:18.739 --> 00:01:20.396
because that would be amazing.

00:01:21.522 --> 00:01:22.354
- [Voiceover] Wow, you're the first person

00:01:22.354 --> 00:01:23.639
that can do that today.

00:01:23.639 --> 00:01:24.805
How do you feel about that?

00:01:26.095 --> 00:01:28.512
- I've always thought
that I had a big mouth,

00:01:28.512 --> 00:01:29.886
but now it's confirmed.

00:01:30.903 --> 00:01:35.802
(upbeat music)

